# Timezone

Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind v4. The shop is a watch storefront. Supabase holds the catalog.

- Load watches with `getWatches()` in `src/lib/watches.ts`. Do not paste catalog rows into components.
- Format money with `formatPrice()` in `src/lib/catalog.ts`.
- Keep visual tokens in `src/app/globals.css` (`paper`, `ink`, `brass`, `night`).
- Server Components read Supabase. Use `src/lib/supabase/client.ts` only from client components.
- Do not commit `.env.local`, service-role keys, or database passwords.

```tsx
// Good: the page renders whatever the table returns
const pieces = await getWatches();

// Bad: a second catalog living in the component
const pieces = [{ name: "Meridian", price: 1280 }];
```
